# Nila needs no keys.
#
# The app makes no API calls: cleartext is forbidden in
# network_security_config.xml, and the only outbound requests it can make are
# two optional model downloads whose URLs are constants in the source.
#
# This file exists so that stays true. If you add something that needs a
# credential, put it here as an empty key, put the real value in .env, and
# .gitignore will keep .env out of the repository.
#
# Example, if a future build adds a hosted fallback:
# NILA_TRANSLATION_API_KEY=
